style='font-size:12.0pt'>         &lt;/span>&lt;/b>&lt;span style='font-size:12.0pt'>There
are many aspects to the total meaning of the Lord's Supper, and there are many
ways of applying those meanings to Christian life and worship. As a result any
number of scripture passages connect naturally to the experience of coming
around the Lord's table with fellow Christians. Below are several portions of
scripture that belong among those that speak of matters relevant to this
worship experience.&lt;/span>&lt;/p></description></item><item><title>GROUP PRAYER PATTERNS</title><link>https://christir.org/essays/ministry/christian-ministry-102/group-prayer-patterns/</link><pubDate>Thu, 02 Apr 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://christir.org/essays/ministry/christian-ministry-102/group-prayer-patterns/</guid><description>&lt;style>
